> The task is deliberately easy. Because the agent receives the estimates, an exact calculator solves it, every lost dollar comes from the agent's reasoning and answer under our protocol, and the calculator prices a perfect tool call. The scope follows from that design: one bidder, a pay-your-bid objective, empirical win curves from eBay closing prices, and $\le$14B open checkpoints, under forced budgets up to 768 tokens and a 1{,}024-token run without forcing.
